  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.15 - Fixer UX and trust metadata hardening\n\n            Changed:\n            - Added descriptor-specific code-fix trust so analyzer-only AM002 and AM030 descriptors no longer look fixable\n            - Hardened AM003 and AM021 collection fixers so interface and set destinations use executable concrete collection rewrites\n            - Clarified manual-review AM004 and AM006 action titles and prefixed AM005 equivalence keys\n            - Added coverage for list, set, and read-only interface fixer branches\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM002, AM003, AM004, AM005, AM006, AM021, AM030, and RuleCatalog coverage\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.14 - AM021 reverse map element diagnostics",
